{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act9d0_level_act9d0_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act9d0",
  "stageId": "act9d0_02",
  "title": "偶然",
  "storyCode": "DM-2",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act9d0/level_act9d0_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d579f6dcd127f9460aed2619130fa04915dc17bfa6e4e837d381bb656cdd6b3a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_barracks"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁，这些家伙是上次的——他们怎么找到这里的！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赶紧撤退！别磨蹭了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已经被包围了，敌人数量很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就赶紧找一个方向突破！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敌人的斥候已经解决了我们的所有岗哨，敌明我暗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少废话！难道要站在这里等着被术师轰死吗！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，你是、你是赫德雷那边的......你为什么在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫德雷呢？他的人呢？他才是负责——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你毁了我的通讯设备！你想做什么——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......真吵啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "负责巡逻的人的确是我喔，这样才方便在你们的营地周围设好源石炸药嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你！赫德雷！你们出卖......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别说得这么难听。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们只是要出趟远门，正好这时候有客人上门，总得有人留下看家嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果给客人留下些甜点，尽到待客之道，也就不至于再被穷追猛打了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "于是，就只好辛苦你们啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你早就该发现敌情，你是故意把我们留在这里送死——！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哼嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们就努力挣扎一下吧，拖得越久，我们就能走得越远。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——再一次，由衷感谢你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_barracks"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "命令是帮助其他没来得及逃走的小队，不过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......为什么没有其他人逃出来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们自愿留下来殿后了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心吧，我给他们留下了一点小小的礼物......所以他们会帮我们拖住敌人的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我可不觉得这里会有谁舍己为人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "牺牲他人，优先保全自己的队伍，无可指摘的判断，用不着用谎言粉饰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但对上司隐瞒实情就完全是另一回事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你骗不过我的眼睛，W，注意你自己的言行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你嫩得很。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......铭记在心，伊内丝队长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毕竟我们还要共处......很长时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——无妨，事情已经发生了，反正到最后都是殊途同归。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许W的决定是对的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你真的这么想？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们和这处营地里的任何萨卡兹都没有一丁点关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们的身份，他们的过往，他们的生和死，都和我们无关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真坚决啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先谈工作，伊内丝，你和W分头带人离开，随军信使保持无线电静默，然后去指定地点汇合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我之后会跟上的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......还有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不管你们怎么互相利用，不许直接向对方下手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不直接就行？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这倒是挺宽松的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不希望这种情况出现，但说实话，我也管不着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但如果想好好活下去，至少现在，就先让每一个萨卡兹物尽其用吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "赫德雷一直是这样。\n该想的事情，想得很少，想了也没用的事情，想得很多。\n......我不否认W是个优秀的战士，但是她欠缺了太多的东西。\n如果她只不过是一个非常非常善于战斗的萨卡兹......\n......哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_coldforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天还没黑，你就一定要自己生一簇篝火躲在这里吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，你好像很喜欢篝火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但是我并不喜欢被人打扰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的队伍比预定的汇合时间慢了三个小时。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那场袭击，是你和赫德雷规划好的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你去问赫德雷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他不知道这件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那就只是偶然。在那里的雇佣兵都不是什么省油的灯，招来记恨，理所当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么嘛，我还以为是赫德雷故意暴露位置的呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你觉得应该这么做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么不这么做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎么知道我们不是在骗你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想杀我你们早就动手了，这样做对各自有什么好处吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在加入我们之前，你在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，都事到如今了，还要搞入职面试吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫德雷从不追问队员的过去，但我不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的确和我们不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......想找茬吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过据我所知，伊内丝小姐似乎不太擅长近身搏杀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "教你一点吧，想要活得久些，就不要过于依赖你力量的某个部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每一个萨卡兹雇佣兵，都带着刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这我倒是有点意外，我以为那是你的法杖，不过——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——呵，“萨卡兹雇佣兵”？你吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——啧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还是觉得你在白刃战里毫无胜算，不过，嗯，的确因为大意被摆了一道呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢啦，只是在手臂上留下了一点小划痕，算是个便宜的教训。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在喜欢装神弄鬼留后手这点上，你和赫德雷还是挺像的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你才让我觉得奇怪，像你这么高调的雇佣兵，基本都死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者说，你能在这么短的时间里引起那么多同行的兴趣，在你加入之前我却从未听说过你，怀疑是理所当然的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你当时是故意靠近赫德雷的，为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你自己说过啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡兹戴尔有很多人想要他的人头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你竟然能坦白得这么冷静，那为什么改变了主意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......感觉这样更有赚头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想要赚到什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不关你事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你动摇了，真有趣，明明随便找个借口就能搪塞过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——又是你的源石技艺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是讨人厌的眼睛，我的理由与你无关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就说不好了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么声音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......东面，有什么在靠近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不止一支队伍，但应该只有一支队伍是真货。哼，真够谨慎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，听上去规模很大，他们雇了多少人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......赫德雷说的没错，这场战斗比以往都要庞大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前面会是我们未曾经历过的战场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怕了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫德雷应该会和本队一起抵达这里，让信使打开无线电。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你敢命令我......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好好好，是是是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就继续守着这篝火吧。我去营地里看看情况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个就是......巴别塔的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_coldforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，中途修改了一次路线，浪费了一点时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是从这里向前，工作才算真的开始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "全员就位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......你那边呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "万无一失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......从烧灼的草地和整齐开裂的泥土来看，你们两个似乎没在这里闲着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，只是热身运动，可算不上“直接出手”喔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心吧。下一次我会在别人发现之前让你的尸首沉入暗影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "重申一遍，我们的任务很简单，不要让任何人靠近目标。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把所有可疑的危险杜绝在这片峡谷之外，靠近的人无需警告，直接开火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有什么疑问吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，目的地是哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能说。护卫任务是分段进行的，路线图已经分发下去，三天后抵达终点，会有人来交接。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......赫德雷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们运的是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这也是——慢着，伊内丝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用你的法术试探运输队伍是违反合约的，不要小看他们，停手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可你说他们只是运输队——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "运输队......不，是我先入为主了，这的确是需要保护的运输队——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但他们在运的是......巨大的，这个影子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......一艘船？不，是一副......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "骨架？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
